invariant: INV-33
file: webpki_cert.c
catches: webpki_cert_test
reason: the full parser the walk reads each certificate with takes
  CH_WEBPKI_LEAF_PIN_CERT_MAX, the cap of the reader pins alone use, in
  place of CH_WEBPKI_CERT_MAX, so it parses certificates past the bound
  the webpki_cert proof covers. test/webpki_cert_mutants.h's and
  test/webpki_cert_key_mutants.h's rows, which want a certificate of 3073
  bytes refused by the parser, object.

--- old
    if (!read_certificate_head(cert, cert_len, CH_WEBPKI_CERT_MAX, &r, out)) {
--- new
    if (!read_certificate_head(cert, cert_len, CH_WEBPKI_LEAF_PIN_CERT_MAX, &r, out)) {
